---
title: "Baton — UML Sequence: OAuth Connection Flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Frontend as 🌐 baton-front
    participant API as ⚡ Baton API
    participant Encrypt as 🔒 EncryptionService
    participant Connector as 🔌 PlatformConnector
    participant DynamoDB as 🗄️ DynamoDB
    participant Platform as 🏗️ External Platform

    Note over User,Platform: Step 1 — Initiate OAuth

    User->>Frontend: Click "Connect Procore"
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/connections/procore/authorize
    API->>Connector: authorize(orgId, userId)
    Connector->>Connector: Generate CSRF state<br/>(+ PKCE verifier for Xero)
    Connector-->>API: {redirectUrl, state, codeVerifier?}
    API->>DynamoDB: Store oauth-state<br/>{state, orgId, userId, platform,<br/>codeVerifier, ttl: 10min}
    API-->>Frontend: {redirectUrl}
    Frontend->>Platform: Redirect to OAuth consent screen

    Note over User,Platform: Step 2 — User Grants Access

    User->>Platform: Approve access
    Platform->>Frontend: Redirect to callback<br/>/auth/callback?code=xxx&state=yyy

    Note over User,Platform: Step 3 — Token Exchange

    Frontend->>API: POST /api/auth/callback<br/>{code, state, platform}
    API->>DynamoDB: Lookup oauth-state by state
    DynamoDB-->>API: {orgId, userId, platform, codeVerifier}
    API->>DynamoDB: Delete oauth-state (one-time use)

    API->>Connector: handleCallback({code, state, codeVerifier})
    Connector->>Platform: POST /oauth/token<br/>{code, client_id, client_secret, ...}
    Platform-->>Connector: {access_token, refresh_token,<br/>expires_in, scope}
    Connector-->>API: OAuthTokens

    Note over User,Platform: Step 4 — Secure Storage

    API->>Connector: testConnection(accessToken)
    Connector->>Platform: GET /api/me (lightweight check)
    Platform-->>Connector: {id, name, ...}
    Connector-->>API: {healthy: true, details: {accountId, name}}

    API->>Encrypt: encrypt(accessToken)
    Encrypt-->>API: {ciphertext, iv, tag}
    API->>Encrypt: encrypt(refreshToken)
    Encrypt-->>API: {ciphertext, iv, tag}

    API->>DynamoDB: PutItem → platform-connections<br/>{id, orgId, platform, status: "healthy",<br/>encryptedAccessToken, encryptedRefreshToken,<br/>tokenExpiresIn, tokenCreatedAt, accountId}

    API-->>Frontend: {connection: {id, platform, status}}
    Frontend-->>User: ✅ "Procore connected!"

    Note over User,Platform: Later — Token Refresh (every 5 min cron check)

    rect rgb(255, 249, 235)
        API->>DynamoDB: Scan connections<br/>where tokenExpired
        DynamoDB-->>API: [expiring connections]
        loop Each expiring connection
            API->>Encrypt: decrypt(encryptedRefreshToken)
            Encrypt-->>API: refreshToken
            API->>Connector: refreshToken(refreshToken)
            Connector->>Platform: POST /oauth/token<br/>{grant_type: refresh_token}
            Platform-->>Connector: New tokens
            Connector-->>API: OAuthTokens
            API->>Encrypt: encrypt(newAccessToken)
            API->>DynamoDB: Update connection tokens
        end
    end
